      "description": "This dashboard provides a high-level overview of key Redis metrics to help you monitor your Redis primary's performance and manage your Redis instance.\n\nFor more information, see:\n\n- Our [official Redis documentation](https://docs.datadoghq.com/integrations/redisdb/)\n\nOr our 3-part series blog post:\n\n- Part 1: [How to monitor Redis performance metrics](https://www.datadoghq.com/blog/how-to-monitor-redis-performance-metrics/) \n- Part 2: [Collecting Redis metrics](https://www.datadoghq.com/blog/how-to-collect-redis-metrics/)\n- Part 3: [Monitoring Redis with Datadog](https://www.datadoghq.com/blog/monitor-redis-using-datadog/) (cloned)",
      "name": "Redis - Overview"
